Description: # Setup
        
        The required libraries are defined in environment.yml file and the following command installs them automatically.
        
        ```bash
        conda env create
        ``` 
        
        Next to activate the environment
        
        ```bash
        conda activate imcsml
        ```
        
        finally setup the frameworj using python develop
        
        ```bash
        python setup.py develop
        ```
        
        # Running the BEM code
        
        To run BEM implementation as the solver, make a link in config folder
        
        ```bash
        ln -s <your/path/to/BEM> <imcsml_dir>/config/baci-release
        ```
        
        ```bash
        ln -s /home/a11btasa/git_repos/bem/bem /home/a11btasa/git_repos/imcsml/config/bem
        ```
        
        
        
